  "description": "NETXES crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C146 H156 N12 O22 Tb4,2(C2 H6 O1),2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.570-3.922 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.90-111.27°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tb4(μ3-OH)2L6(tmhd)4]·CH3CN·CH3CH2OH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
